    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends the Recovery of Loans by Banks (Special Provisions) Act,No. 4 of 1990 by inserting immediately after section 4 of that Act, new section 4A and the legaleffect as amended is to suspend, the selling of any property mortgaged to the bank as security forany loan in respect of which default has been made, by public auction during the periodcommencing on the date of commencement of section 4A and ending on 15th December, 2024.",
